{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026raNJWag6Z01795748701.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一艘由上環往蛇口的客輪，在青衣油庫對出海面撞到船塢設施，至少25人受傷。</p><p></p><p>涉事客輪被拖到青衣友聯船廠，大批救護人員趕到現場，用擔架將傷者救出，有傷者要用頸箍協助。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHIP-1100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EzFImCA5Um1795748776.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方上午約九時半接報，涉事客輪由上環駛往蛇口，至青衣油庫對出，懷疑撞到船塢設施，造成至少25人受傷，5人情況嚴重、全部清醒，送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.955516+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:12.868567+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:14.572689+00:00","content_hash":"e4f958972ddeda6656ae2f76bd2dc4eb05dedc1d35e49386932790dcb1a1e5a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.955516+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}